From 216bf4d142752a4485421326f964ed0d98f04c71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 14:12:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD terminal visual selection so both panes can copy
 visible text

The terminal UI keeps visual selection state for the focused pane, derives copy text from the rendered pane contents, and emits clipboard output when text is yanked. The terminal app and harness pass visible right-pane content into the shared UI state so right-pane copy works against what the user can see.
